<article class="env-remark" id="05IC">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/05IC">Remark <span data-tag="05IC">38.12.3</span>.</a> There is a variant of Lemma <a href="/tag/05IB" data-tag="05IB">38.12.2</a> where we weaken the flatness condition by assuming only that $N$ is flat at some given prime $\mathfrak q$ lying over $\mathfrak r$ but where we strengthen the dévissage condition by assuming the existence of a complete dévissage <em>at $\mathfrak q$</em>. Compare with Lemma <a href="/tag/05I4" data-tag="05I4">38.10.2</a>. </p>
</article>